    <body>
        <p><b>Sankskrit Name</b> - Padahastasana</p>
        <p><b>Benefits</b> - Improves flexibility in hamstrings, boosts digestion.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">How to Practice</p>
        <ol>
            <li>
                <p>Exhale, fold forward from the hips.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Place palms beside feet, keeping knees slightly bent if needed.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </body>
</html>